%% RSS Radar — 采集 / 去重 / 当天数据读写 / 次日转历史 / 通知 关键时序
%% v1.1：当天数据改为「追加事件流 + 折叠 + 投影快照」（方案 C 双写）；落盘到 deploy 部署分支。

sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as GitHub Actions(collect.yml, cron 7)
    participant Coll as Collector(scripts/collect)
    participant Store as DataStore(deploy 分支)
    participant Conn as Connector(某一源)
    participant Norm as Normalizer
    participant Cls as Classifier
    participant Exc as ExclusionEngine
    participant Dedup as DedupEngine
    participant Ana as Analytics
    participant Notify as Notifier(notify/)

    Cron->>Coll: 触发采集(date = 当天 Asia/Shanghai)

    Note over Coll,Store: 跨天时先封口前一天（§6.8）
    Coll->>Store: rolloverIfNewDay(today)
    Store->>Store: 折叠昨天事件流 → 追加进月度 NDJSON + 移动当天快照 + 更新 history-index

    par 并发抓取(全局≤6, 单请求超时15s)
        Coll->>Conn: get(source.type).run(source) with ETag/If-Modified-Since
        Conn-->>Coll: 200 rawItems / 304 复用 / 4xx·5xx 记错
    end

    Coll->>Norm: 归一化(时间→UTC, 去HTML, 截断, 生成 dedupKey/id)
    Norm-->>Coll: items
    Coll->>Cls: classify(items)
    Cls-->>Coll: items(含 category)
    Coll->>Exc: exclude(items, config/exclusions.json)
    Exc->>Exc: 整源停用(最前) / 条目级 / 分类级；写入 stats/exclusions-*.json
    Exc-->>Coll: items(过滤后) + hits

    Coll->>Store: appendNdjson(today/events-<date>.ndjson, items)   # ★真·追加 O(1)
    Store->>Store: foldByLastWrite(events) → Map<id,item>           # last-write-wins 逻辑去重
    Coll->>Dedup: dedupAndMerge(state)
    Dedup->>Dedup: L1/L2 精确分组 → SimHash64+LSH 预筛 → Dice 精算 → L4 跨源归并
    Dedup-->>Coll: groups(主条目 sources[] sourceCount)

    Coll->>Store: writeJsonCompact(today/snapshot-<date>.json)      # 投影快照(覆盖写)
    Coll->>Store: writeCsv(snapshot) + writePointer(today/latest.json)
    Coll->>Ana: buildReport(snapshot)
    Ana-->>Coll: report → 写 today/report-<date>.json
    Coll->>Store: commit deploy 分支(当天 amend / 跨天新建, "[skip ci]")

    Note over Coll,Notify: 采集结束后：实时阈值判定（§12.3）
    Coll->>Notify: maybeRealtimeAlert(report, thresholds)
    Notify->>Notify: 去重(幂等键) + 限频 + 每日上限 + 静默时段
    Notify-->>Conn: 命中则投递(邮箱/飞书/钉钉/企业微信)
    Notify->>Store: 写 stats/notify-<ts>.json

    Note over Store: 前端运行时 fetch raw.githubusercontent.com/<owner>/rss-radar/deploy/today/latest.json
    Note over Store: → snapshot + report（≤5 分钟 CDN TTL；无需重建）
    Note over Store: 历史：history-index.json(趋势,1次) + history/YYYY/MM/items.ndjson(明细,按月) + snapshot-<date>.json(回看)

    Note over Cron,Store: 另：notify.yml 定时(默认 08:00 Asia/Shanghai)推前一天日报；archive.yml 每年1/1归档
